1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,240
Why is fishing the writer's favourite sport?
为什么钓鱼是作者最喜爱的一项运动？

2
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:19,330
Why is fishing the writer's favourite sport?
为什么钓鱼是作者最喜爱的一项运动？

3
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:25,070
Fishing is my favourite sport.
钓鱼是我特别喜爱的一项运动。

4
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:30,870
I often fish for hours without catching anything.
我经常一钓数小时却一无所获。

5
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:33,640
But this does not worry me.
但我从不为此烦恼。

6
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,110
Some fishermen are unlucky.
有些垂钓者就是不走运。

7
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,130
Instead of catching fish,
他们往往鱼钓不到，

8
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,750
they catch old boots and rubbish.
却钓上来些旧靴子和垃圾。

9
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:46,740
I am even less lucky.
我的运气甚至还不及他们。

10
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:50,460
I never catch anything --not even old boots.
我什么东西也未钓到过——就连旧靴子也没有。

11
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:55,860
After having spent whole mornings on the river,
我总是在河上待上整整一上午，

12
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:59,150
I always go home with an empty bag.
然后空着袋子回家。

13
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,970
'You must give up fishing!'
“你可别再钓鱼了！”

14
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:07,460
my friends say. 'It's a waste of time.'
我的朋友们说，“这是浪费时间。”

15
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:12,830
But they don't realize one important thing.
然而他们没有认识到很重要的一点。

16
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:16,610
I'm not really interested in fishing.
我并不是真的对钓鱼有兴趣。

17
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:22,650
I am only interested in sitting in a boat and doing nothing at all!
我感兴趣的只是独坐孤舟，无所事事！
